@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
scale 1 as 70 pixels
hide time-axis

concise "수신" as R
concise "Batch" as B
concise "Instance" as I

@0
R is "r1"
B is "열림 (batch N)"
I is "대기"

@1
R is "r2"

@2
R is "latch"
B is "N 닫힘"
I is "N 평가"

@3
R is "r3"

@4
I is "N 확정 + dispatch"

@5
R is "r4"

@6
R is "latch"
B is "N+1 닫힘: r3, r4"
I is "N+1 평가"

@7
R is "-"
I is "대기"

B@2 <-> @6 : r3와 r4는 latch 이후 도착 -> N+1을 기다림
@enduml
